    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The kingmaker's decisive intervention from the highest authority propelled a boundary-crosser to victory in the site of a significant election, winning the party's nomination by defying the money trail. This successful frontier breach in politics marks a changing of the guard, as the entrenched incumbent faced an unprecedented defeat for an incumbent. The election winner now advances to the general election, opening a new, uncertain contest with potential to reshape the U.S. Senate.",
